    },
    {
      "type": "prose",
      "text": "Here $x(t) \\leftrightarrow X(s)$ with ROC $R_x$, and $y(t) \\leftrightarrow Y(s)$ with ROC $R_y$. Properties of the Transform (#/math/laplace-transform/properties) works through them on the surface."
    },
